shiji-073-baiwang"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p011","text":"始皇聞之，大怒，自馳如頻陽，見謝王翦曰：「寡人以不用將軍計，李信果辱秦軍。今聞荊兵日進而西，將軍雖病，獨忍棄寡人乎！」王翦謝曰：「老臣罷病悖亂，唯大王更擇賢將。」始皇謝曰：「已矣，將軍勿復言！」王翦曰：「大王必不得已用臣，非六十萬人不可。」始皇曰：「為聽將軍計耳。」於是王翦將兵六十萬人，始皇自送至灞上。王翦行，請美田宅園池甚眾。始皇曰：「將軍行矣，何憂貧乎？」王翦曰：「為大王將，有功終不得封侯，故及大王之向臣，臣亦及時以請園池為子孫業耳。」始皇大笑。王翦既至關，使使還請善田者五輩。或曰：「將軍之乞貸，亦已甚矣。」王翦曰：「不然。夫秦王怚而不信人。今空秦國甲士而專委於我，我不多請田宅為子孫業以自堅，顧令秦王坐而疑我邪？」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"李信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004265","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-01