ang:m011-0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0243","start":243,"end":245,"surface":"或曰","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名使者、說話者、群體或族屬保持未定；不補成員及姓名，不將相近語句視為同一匿名人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0247","start":247,"end":249,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0259","start":259,"end":261,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0268","start":268,"end":270,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0295","start":295,"end":297,"surface":"子孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名使者、說話者、群體或族屬保持未定；不補成員及姓名，不將相近語句視為同一匿名人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m011-0304","start":304,"end":306,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004259","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang","book_id":"b-shiji-073","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-073-baiwang"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p012","text":"王翦果代李信擊荊。荊聞王翦益軍而來，乃悉國中兵以拒秦。王翦至，堅壁而守之，不肯戰。荊兵數出挑戰，終不出。王翦日休士洗沐，而善飲食撫循之，親與士卒同食。久之，王翦使人問軍中戲乎？對曰：「方投石超距。」於是王翦曰：「士卒可用矣。」荊數挑戰而秦不出，乃引而東。翦因舉兵追之，令壯士擊，大破荊軍。至蘄南，殺其將軍項燕，荊兵遂敗走。秦因乘勝略定荊地城邑。歲餘，虜荊王負芻，竟平荊地為郡縣。因南征百越之君。而王翦子王賁，與李信破定燕、齊地。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m012-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"李信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004265","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m012-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004258","status":"cont